{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath VELEV lies a hidden realm. An explorer stumbles upon a colossal void within the Earth, stepping into not the anticipated gloom but a radiant world where technology and nature blend in harmony. This uncharted territory unveils itself, brimming with unheard-of creatures, monsters, and gems. Thus begins the explorer's grand quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as mere curiosity escalates into a profound venture for the explorer. Armed with resources gleaned from mining, they forge and enhance their gear, readying themselves for confrontations with formidable beasts. Delving deeper unveils novel experiences and allies, as each step sheds light on the enigmas of this secret world. The quest is ceaseless, an ongoing odyssey towards the truths veiled by the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvPvE MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling PvP arena action: Skillfully aim and dodge using your mouse, where mastery and strategy unlock victory. Engage in diverse battlegrounds, each offering unique experiences. Skill and strategic insight pave the way to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your character through PvE, securing gear and growth through extraction. The depths of VELEV are rich with resources and elusive treasures, empowering characters and unlocking new abilities. Harness these to enhance your character's prowess and innovate your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Classes and Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While solo play shines, the true potential unfolds with strategic class combinations. Each class boasts abilities and skills synergizing with VELEV's distinct environs. Team dynamics are crucial, leveraging class synergies to forge indomitable parties. Venture through VELEV's myriad landscapes, where collaboration and strategy reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2790930?t=1744670550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2790930?t=1744670550","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/f6d1af1e7532cda6aad37792ab627a4d9cbb770f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744670550","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/f6d1af1e7532cda6aad37792ab627a4d9cbb770f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744670550","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/27d3a8c316f37c00139b224f38077801.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath VELEV lies a hidden realm. An explorer stumbles upon a colossal void within the Earth, stepping into not the anticipated gloom but a radiant world where technology and nature blend in harmony. This uncharted territory unveils itself, brimming with unheard-of creatures, monsters, and gems. Thus begins the explorer's grand quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/2a6a8d3ca3c392ddab1e129f0624709f.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as mere curiosity escalates into a profound venture for the explorer. Armed with resources gleaned from mining, they forge and enhance their gear, readying themselves for confrontations with formidable beasts. Delving deeper unveils novel experiences and allies, as each step sheds light on the enigmas of this secret world. The quest is ceaseless, an ongoing odyssey towards the truths veiled by the unknown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/fb5c4325ebeb4344c6f2a3b154549521.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvPvE MOBA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling PvP arena action: Skillfully aim and dodge using your mouse, where mastery and strategy unlock victory. Engage in diverse battlegrounds, each offering unique experiences. Skill and strategic insight pave the way to triumph.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/8a47ebbe5f98b83c7eef4ff236fd2c5e.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance your character through PvE, securing gear and growth through extraction. The depths of VELEV are rich with resources and elusive treasures, empowering characters and unlocking new abilities. Harness these to enhance your character's prowess and innovate your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.poster.avif?t=1744670550\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.webm?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/extras/76d86dec742752f53826e3dbe91b01c2.mp4?t=1744670550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse Classes and Synergies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While solo play shines, the true potential unfolds with strategic class combinations. Each class boasts abilities and skills synergizing with VELEV's distinct environs. Team dynamics are crucial, leveraging class synergies to forge indomitable parties. Venture through VELEV's myriad landscapes, where collaboration and strategy reign supreme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Chaf"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2790930/header.jpg?t=1744670550","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Latest macOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li